| `MAKEFLAGS` | string | set by make: the flag word, options and command-line variables | set by make | `WRITE_GUARD`; the `verify` recipe, through `scripts/gate_evidence.py` | Nothing to set here: `WRITE_GUARD` stops make with an error when its first word holds `i` (`-i`, `--ignore-errors` or a bare `.IGNORE:`), because make would ignore the guard's `exit 1`. | `.IGNORE: <target>`, which leaves it alone and which check_W refuses | always |
